cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "CMGSteer: control-moment-gyro singularity analysis and steering laws"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-02
license: AGPL-3.0-or-later
authors:
  - name: "OPTIMA Organisation"
repository-code: "https://github.com/OmAcharya-avtr/cmgsteer"
abstract: >-
  Single-gimbal control-moment-gyro array geometry for pyramid and roof
  configurations, the momentum map and its Jacobian verified against numerical
  differentiation, the singularity measure with analytic construction and
  classification of the internal and external singular set, four steering laws
  (Moore-Penrose pseudo-inverse, singularity-robust inverse, generalised
  singularity-robust inverse and null-motion reconfiguration) with the
  SR-inverse torque error checked against its closed form, gimbal-rate
  saturation and CMG-failure handling, and a learned null-motion policy
  benchmarked against the classical policies with paired bootstrap confidence
  intervals. Research-grade, not flight-qualified.
keywords:
  - control moment gyro
  - singularity
  - steering law
  - spacecraft attitude control
  - aerospace
